<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260121T121050" id="12ee6345-d5af-447f-97ff-9e7aadfb8a06">
    <XRef DateTime="20260121T120501" id="f0aab7a4-5bee-4dff-9a58-577552de2ace"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Outline 1" id="dcd46ba3-4c48-42b6-81c2-23c788b7b918">
      <Text>Act 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Summary" id="be55a867-d6d3-4569-ac9c-5cfde8544130">
      <Text>Luke discovers his abilities and must learn to control them while the tragic event of his family dying forces him to leave home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="37ff2f78-9e09-4b10-9d1f-ed08d7e5e9fc">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BERU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LUKE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="OWEN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THREEPIO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>ExT. lars family home - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7720a13-73cc-45af-842f-d202056b0af8">
      <Text>Outside their home, LUKE and AUNT </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BERU</Text>
      <Text> are talking while the Jawa </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sandcrawller</Text>
      <Text> stops near OWEN who is beginning to converse with the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jawas</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c27b2ae4-5eff-4be6-a432-948822c1cb40">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Beru</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b43bf3d-f214-4bd1-b079-15f22638abb5">
      <Text>Luke, tell Owen that if he gets a translator to be sure it speaks Bocce.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="674da971-fb3c-4632-8a53-499fff1af4ed">
      <Text>Luke</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a366523-a7d0-4b7d-875c-7bd95973e748">
      <Text>It looks like we don’t have much of a choice but I’ll remind him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b602993c-a2da-42bd-bc1b-992c0d7d888f">
      <Text>Luke returns to his uncle as they look over the equipment for sale with the Jawa leader.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="493e3d4e-d877-4531-bf16-81c6dc69ad6e">
      <Text>Owen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1c786d5-a3b7-4911-b484-862274ed5c68">
      <Text>I have no need for a protocol droid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a019c28c-ef6d-4933-b09f-44ee9618e90e">
      <Text>Threepio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6410c479-794d-4f1b-8abd-7f197ccfb25e">
      <Text>(quickly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4050499c-62dc-4b18-81a6-7fc873785a9f">
      <Text>Sir -- not in an environment such as this -- that’s why I’ve also been programmed for over thirty secondary functions that...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db1be4bb-aceb-4f62-be5c-d89c6fbaa593">
      <Text>Owen </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74c0c4ac-a933-4c21-af04-58947f1c4d62">
      <Text>What I really need is a droid that understands the binary language of moisture vaporators.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="040ada3d-111f-4e3a-8aa4-ff0ae9f19498">
      <Text>Threepio</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50e51ea5-5d73-48e6-b978-6c6438e04b3d">
      <Text>Vaporators! Sir -- My first job was programming binary load lifter... very similar to your vaporators. You could say...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="771c4513-febf-4876-82f1-f76dae7fa1ca">
      <Text>Owen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac3912d3-51e5-4ec0-a2a0-39fa5322048a">
      <Text>Do you speak Bocce?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="982f1532-2786-4de7-a5d2-ab57c37fbcb9"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a891ec0-55f1-44f8-8937-fe340a1b2651">
      <Text>THREEPIO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="739e5d6e-57f0-4077-9c04-c624d1d158d4">
      <Text>Of course I can, sir. It’s like a second language for me... I’m as fluent in Bocce...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="791b0921-7c4b-40fe-8e29-68c5f0651afd">
      <Text>Owen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59cfdef2-18ac-45d2-b0e9-763fe575e132">
      <Text>All right shut up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="cd691cbb-2e58-4ed4-853a-7c87631d3013">
      <Text>(turning to Jawa)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1e6742cf-9204-4de6-9d8f-6d6ee857a1ab">
      <Text>I’ll take this one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0af09781-b3d8-4439-8ca3-7dd873466132">
      <Text>ThREEPIO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="437f9d70-b780-4759-a988-ef002efa53aa">
      <Text>Shutting up, sir.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1123cd00-2bca-46aa-b173-256c9d1ff202">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BEN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. tatooine - wasteland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3af968e2-4529-48f9-b517-cb55281db9b7">
      <Text>The Landspeeder with Luke, Artoo, Threepio, and Ben in it zooms across the desert. The speeder stops on a bluff overlooking the spaceport at Mos Eisley. It is a haphazard array of low, grey, concrete structures and semi-domes. A harsh gale blows across the stark canyon floor. Luke adjusts his goggles and walks to the edge of the craggy bluff where Ben is standing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b4277423-e0bc-4dd9-a2f3-219eaf04d3cf">
      <Text>Ben</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="911554ee-417b-4785-b566-019b856a4414">
      <Text>Mos Eisley Spaceport. You will never find a more wretched hive of scum and villainy. We must be cautious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f29aeac-5f7f-4bf2-8b7c-b926f73aaaf9">
      <Picture Height="432" Id="d750cb33-a998-42c0-a2f3-d6ba7245c95d" Width="432"/>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1c3dbe0a-4ad2-4319-9792-53e82d1c9780">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CANTINA BAR -  dAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4078ab17-677d-4877-87a0-1a3ac69fb190"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Outline 1" id="8def140b-3a99-42a7-b852-5791af2cfebb">
      <Text>Act 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Summary" id="2172e7da-e5a6-40f9-9b66-d08d3dc55e43">
      <Text>In leaving and trying to escape he is in danger of being captured by the empire. He finds a princess and decides to aid her with also escaping. Through this struggle he loses his mentor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Outline 2" id="75fbbd85-90b3-4606-b991-59daec901844">
      <Text>Central Conflict</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.13" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="c4ad1ee5-ea34-4af4-bfa7-3802071f5dad">
      <Text>1. Luke's goal is to realise his mystical powers and stand up against the empire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.13" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="2142b705-0d23-48c0-8fb4-00a023bfd20a">
      <Text>2. The main obstacle is the empire and learning about the mystical powers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.13" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="1f398228-b56d-4246-8580-87fd85bdbd80">
      <Text>3. Luke must grow as a person learning about the mystical powers and use his skills to confront the empire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.13" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="c537bef3-b6ef-43be-a083-6b46be8957ae">
      <Text>4. The worst thing that can happen is that he cannot master the power and therefore dies trying to stand up to the empire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.13" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="15" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Summary" id="6d100800-0b92-40df-8eb8-c8f88ada7535">
      <Text>5. Luke has to change to understand the nature of the universe and be comfortable in high pressure situations.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Outline 1" id="79848527-9b33-4857-babd-380513fe6073">
      <Text>Act 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Summary" id="67f12446-cf22-408c-a93f-d5f6164195d4">
      <Text>With the empire chasing Luke he has no choice but to fight and to use his powers to deal a blow to the empire and survive himself along with all of the rebellion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

