  <ListItems>
    <ListItem Id="11892d8c-669a-46d5-a5ef-472348543f0f" Title="Star Wars" Type="Beat">
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Luke discovers his mystical powers and uses said powers to destroy the oppressive imperial regime.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
    <ListItem Id="f0ac76a7-75fb-4b7b-a6be-cebab3bb84f4" Title="Luke" Type="Beat">
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.33" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Luke lives with his aunt and uncle on the fringes of the empire. He has aspirations to join the rebellion but is not old enough to do so.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.33" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">He is a moisture farmer alongside his aunt and uncle.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
    <ListItem Id="11113810-7569-49f9-a41d-f022a217e3cb" Title="Act 1" Type="Beat">
      <SubordinateTo Length="19.000" Level="Outline 1" Number="0.000" Order="0" Type="PageGoal"/>
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Luke discovers his abilities and must learn to control them while the tragic event of his family dying forces him to leave home.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
    <ListItem Id="62f587dd-d61d-46a2-bd0d-3d50fc92640d" Title="Act 3" Type="Beat">
      <SubordinateTo Length="20.000" Level="Outline 1" Number="59.125" Order="0" Type="PageGoal"/>
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">With the empire chasing Luke he has no choice but to fight and to use his powers to deal a blow to the empire and survive himself along with all of the rebellion.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
    <ListItem Id="d0986ef1-0fb4-418d-9253-8713e4e03e5f" Title="Vader" Type="Beat">
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Vader is a general for the empire and possesses mystical powers which he uses to subjugate citizens and non citizens.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">His purpose is to serve the emperor.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
    <ListItem Id="3a90200f-b50e-43fb-a131-ad55c74834ef" Title="Central Conflict" Type="Beat">
      <SubordinateTo Length="39.875" Level="Outline 2" Number="19.000" Order="0" Type="PageGoal"/>
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">1. </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Lukes</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""> goal is to realise his mystical powers and stand up against the empire.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">2. The main obstacle is the empire and learning about the mystical powers.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">3. Luke must grow as a person learning about the mystical powers and use his skills to confront the empire.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">4. The worst thing that can happen is that he cannot master the power and therefore dies trying to stand up to the empire.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">5. Luke has to change to understand the nature of the universe and be comfortable in high pressure situations.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
    <ListItem Id="ded95a71-6f2c-452d-9cb5-49f3917327f3" Title="Act 2" Type="Beat">
      <SubordinateTo Length="40.125" Level="Outline 1" Number="19.000" Order="0" Type="PageGoal"/>
      <Content>
        <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="3.06" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Font="Arial" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">In leaving and trying to escape he is in danger of being captured by the empire. He finds a princess and decides to aid her with also escaping. Through this struggle he loses his mentor.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Content>
    </ListItem>
  </ListItems>

